re calculated\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Multivariable linear regression models were used to estimate racial disparities in the difference of excess heart age\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Data were analyzed using statistical software that accounted for each surveys' complex sampling design.\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 1\", \"q\": \"Age-standardized by the direct method to the U.S. 2010 census population\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 2\", \"q\": \"p-value based on t-tests across the age group.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}